# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository, regardless of which
# OS/editor (Windows cmd, WSL, IntelliJ) commits them. Git still checks
# them out as LF everywhere unless overridden below or in a nested
# .gitattributes (see apps/user-service, libs/java-commons for mvnw/*.cmd).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
